    {
      "cells": [
        {
          "segments": [
            {
              "text": "15-50% - Braelon Allen",
              "bold": true,
              "italic": false,
              "newline": false
            },
            {
              "text": "• If you’re 0-3/1-2 and down bad at RB you can get pretty aggressive here.",
              "bold": false,
              "italic": false,
              "newline": true
            },
            {
              "text": "• Breece is week to week but would guess he’s more likely to miss 2-4",
              "bold": false,
              "italic": false,
              "newline": true
            },
            {
              "text": "• Braelon Allen would be the 1 for 1 replacement as a firm RB2 in any game Breece misses. If you’re back is against the wall that’s extremely valuable. If he wouldn’t slot in your lineup immediately be much less aggressive (remember my ranges are wide to leave room for format/needs)",
              "bold": false,
              "italic": false,
              "newline": true
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "cells": [
        {
          "segments": [
            {
              "text": "10-35% - Ollie Gordon",
              "bold": true,
              "italic": false,
              "newline": false
            },
            {
              "text": "• I wouldn’t go crazy chasing the Achane replacement but Gordon is the odds on favorite.",
              "bold": false,
              "italic": false,
              "newline": true
            },
            {
              "text": "• Gordon was 17-41-1. Back to own but would just temper expectations.65% stuff rate, -34 RYOE. This is not a free square. This is like 65% of the headache that was Achane thru 2 weeks",
              "bold": false,
              "italic": false,
              "newline": true
            },
            {
              "text": "• Similar deal. This comes down to how down bad you are at RB.",
              "bold": false,
              "italic": false,
              "newline": true
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
