            {
              "text": "• Has operated ahead of Gordon at times but has been banged up. Could very well overtake Gordon in a week’s time. More finesse/speed to Gordon’s bruiser styler. Prefer stealing Wright at 5%-10% over splurging 40%+ on Gordon",
